 *
 * MCXN only. Deep Power Down retains just SRAMA, kept alive by the VBAT RAM LDO,
 * so the whole retained working set has to live there. Constrain zephyr,sram to
 * RAMA1-RAMA3 -- 24 KB at 0x20002000 -- which stays clear of the boot ROM scratch
 * at the bottom of SRAMA. This is the same window samples/boards/nxp/mcxn_a/s2ram
 * uses.
 *
 * A build that outgrows this window fails at link time; check it with
 * `west build -t ram_report`.
 *
 * MCXA needs no counterpart: the SPC SRAM retention LDO holds all of its SRAM.
 */

&sram0 {
	reg = <0x20002000 0x6000>;
};
